    "sub_name": "循環經濟與地方實踐",
    "sub_ename": "CIRCULAR ECONOMY AND LOCAL PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的在探討地方如何善用在地自然資源與人力資源，推動循環經濟實踐，促進地方自主發展，並結合社會創新與永續經營策略，培養學生地方永續思維與行動能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course explores how local communities utilize natural and human resources to implement circular economy practices and foster autonomous development. It emphasizes social innovation and sustainable strategies, cultivating students' ability to promote local sustainability.",
